The fuzzy-logic method lineage (universes, partitions, IA1->IA2->IA3
architecture) derives from work by Dr. Cícero Romão Cavati and was first
put into production in the Avaltix market-forecasting engine (https://avaltix.io).

This software is a research preview. It is NOT an operational earthquake
early-warning system and MUST NOT be used to make life-safety decisions.
It estimates how a relative probability shifts against a baseline; it does
not predict earthquakes. See DISCLAIMER in README.md.

This product includes data derived from public scientific sources, including
the USGS Comprehensive Catalog (ComCat), the Nevada Geodetic Laboratory (NGL),
and others credited in the source code and documentation. Those datasets remain
under their respective terms and are not redistributed in this repository.
